\newlabel{fig:pvt_norms}{{7}{11}{The L2 norms for all model sizes of PVT. The size of the model gets bigger from left to right. We notice that besides PVT-b0 all norm distributions are bimodal which is a sign of underlying artifacts}{figure.caption.21}{}}
